# Finanzas 3.0 V2.0.1
#
# The Next.js project intentionally requires no Google credential, spreadsheet
# identifier, application password or Supabase service-role key in Vercel.
# Source reading and private-data writes are delegated to protected Supabase
# Edge Functions. Their secrets are configured only in Supabase environment
# management and must never be committed to this repository.
